== D. Team of 10 heavy developers, half of their calls on the hybrid (s=50%), office box, 4 years
  1x RTX PRO 6000 workstation, office: needs 0.56 GPUs at peak -> 1 box(es); box $614/month
  1x RTX 5090 box, office (prefill only): needs 1.36 GPUs at peak -> 2 box(es); box $536/month
  hybrid part with 1 RTX PRO 6000 box + 10 x M5 Max 128 premium: $1,183/month for 262k calls = $4.51 per 1000 calls
  the same calls via Opus 5.5                  : $   14,937/month
  the same calls via Sonnet 5.5                : $   11,974/month
  the same calls via Haiku 5.5                 : $    2,615/month
  the same calls via 27B API median            : $    2,758/month
  the same calls via GLM-5.3-Flash API (Z.ai)  : $    1,484/month
  for scale: all calls of the team (s=100%) via Opus 5.5 list prices: $29,874/month; 10 flat $200 subscriptions: $2,000/month

